# Locally-generated uploads (avatars, pet photos, QR codes, found-report
# photos) — e2e tests exercise the real LocalDiskStorageProvider against
# this directory, same as a real local dev session would. Files already
# tracked here from earlier manual testing are unaffected by this rule.
/uploads/*

# Locally-generated private uploads (NID verification images, Phase 11) —
# never served statically, never committed.
/private-uploads/*

